# hid_smoke.jgs -- jgraph.usb.hidlist and jgraph.usb.hid (device classes plan, stage D6, ADR 0189). A
# JGraph extension with no MATLAB counterpart, so this is a JGraph-only fixture and
# expected/hid_smoke.txt is written from the rule. The cases are MATLAB code in helpers/hid_smoke.m,
# and each answers the same on any Windows machine whatever is plugged in.

print("CHK|empty_list|" + hid_smoke("empty_list") + "|exact");
